      "sourceTextSha256": "5ade372b3d2ccb877eee957091240480d772cb544da8664d5b7d6bc09fc2dbe5",
      "text": "Breakfast. It’s time to farewell the ancient mystical world. After breakfast, begin the descent from the summit to the base of the world’s greatest mountain. Rest along the way and set up camp near the Rio Tek. Farewell dinner. Overnight in tents.\n\n**Meals:** breakfast, lunch (packed), dinner",
